{"id": "ab4f8b86-34ed-4c62-b26e-933248a20d3d", "slug": "auracore-spatial-visualization-system", "title": "AuraCore — Spatial Visualization System", "description": "Auracore Spatial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"AuraCore — Spatial Visualization System\"\ndescription: \"Auracore Spatial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00E5FF\"\n  secondary: \"#050507\"\n  accent: \"#0077FF\"\n  background: \"#050507\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AuraCore — Spatial Visualization System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 72; favorites: 0; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, charts, security, billing.\n## Overview\nAuracore Spatial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAuraCore Platform Architecture Telemetry Documentation Authenticate Initialize Spatial Data Telemetry Map the Architecture of Your Data. Deploy isometric spatial visualizations for your operational metrics — transform s…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map the Architecture of Your Data..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00E5FF, secondary #050507, accent #0077FF, background #050507, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>AuraCore — Spatial Visualization System</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050507] text-white min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden font-sans\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n<!-- WebGL Background -->\n<canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-55\"></canvas>\n\n<!-- DOM fallback gradient -->\n<div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 50%, rgba(20,20,25,0.6) 0%, #050507 70%);\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative z-10\">\n\n  <!-- Nav -->\n  <nav class=\"w-full px-6 lg:px-12 py-5 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded opacity-90\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00E5FF 0%, #0077FF 100%);\"></div>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-tight\">AuraCore</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs text-white/60\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Platform</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Architecture</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Telemetry</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Documentation</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <button class=\"text-xs hidden sm:block text-white/70\">Authenticate</button>\n      <button class=\"text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white text-[#050507]\">Initialize</button>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero / Main split -->\n  <main class=\"relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 lg:py-24\">\n\n    <!-- frame brackets -->\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-10 left-6 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/25\"></span>\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute top-10 right-6 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/25\"></span>\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-6 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/25\"></span>\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-10 right-6 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/25\"></span>\n\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center\">\n\n      <!-- Left -->\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 text-xs font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/50\">\n          <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00E5FF] shadow-[0_0_10px_#00E5FF]\"></span>\n          <span>Spatial Data Telemetry</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 class=\"reveal-headline tracking-tight font-extralight text-[clamp(2.375rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.05]\">\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">Map</span></span>\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">the</span></span>\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">Architecture</span></span>\n          <br />\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">of</span></span>\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">Your</span></span>\n          <span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word\">Data.</span></span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">\n          Deploy isometric spatial visualizations for your operational metrics — transform standard analytics into a high-fidelity 3D control matrix.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- App list -->\n        <div class=\"mt-10 space-y-2 max-w-md\">\n          <button class=\"app-row group w-full flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-left transition bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20\">\n            <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n              <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5.042 15.165a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.52 2.523A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 0 15.165a2.527 2.527 0 0 1 2.522-2.52h2.52v2.52zM6.313 15.165a2.527 2.527 0 0 1 2.521-2.52 2.527 2.527 0 0 1 2.521 2.52v6.313A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 8.834 24a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.521-2.522v-6.313z\" fill=\"#E01E5A\"/><path d=\"M8.834 5.042a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.521-2.52A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 8.834 0a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.521 2.522v2.52H8.834zM8.834 6.313a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.521 2.521 2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.521 2.521H2.522A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 0 8.834a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.522-2.521h6.312z\" fill=\"#36C5F0\"/><path d=\"M18.956 8.834a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.522-2.521A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 24 8.834a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.522 2.521h-2.522V8.834zM17.688 8.834a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.523 2.521 2.527 2.527 0 0 1-2.52-2.521V2.522A2.527 2.527 0 0 1 15.165 0a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.523 2.522v6.312z\" fill=\"#2EB67D\"/><path d=\"M15.165 18.956a2.528 2.528 0 0 1 2.523 2.522A2.528 2.528 0 0 1 15.165 24a2.527 2.527 0 0 1-2.52-2.522v-2.522h2.52zM15.165 17.688a2.527 2.527 0 0 1-2.52-2.523 2.526 2.526 0 0 1 2.52-2.52h6.313A2.527 2.527 0 0 1 24 15.165a2.528 2.528 0 0 1-2.522 2.523h-6.313z\" fill=\"#ECB22E\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1\">\n              <div class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Stream Integration</div>\n              <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/50\">Real-time socket pipeline</div>\n            </div>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-white/40\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"app-row group w-full flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-left transition bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/10\">\n            <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white font-medium text-sm\">N</div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1\">\n              <div class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Graph Syncing</div>\n              <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/50\">Knowledge base protocol</div>\n            </div>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-white/40\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"app-row group w-full flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-left transition bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/10\">\n            <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n              <svg width=\"14\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 38 57\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M19 28.5a9.5 9.5 0 1 1 19 0 9.5 9.5 0 0 1-19 0z\" fill=\"#1abcfe\"/><path d=\"M0 47.5A9.5 9.5 0 0 1 9.5 38H19v9.5a9.5 9.5 0 1 1-19 0z\" fill=\"#0acf83\"/><path d=\"M19 0v19h9.5a9.5 9.5 0 1 0 0-19H19z\" fill=\"#ff7262\"/><path d=\"M0 9.5A9.5 9.5 0 0 0 9.5 19H19V0H9.5A9.5 9.5 0 0 0 0 9.5z\" fill=\"#f24e1e\"/><path d=\"M0 28.5A9.5 9.5 0 0 0 9.5 38H19V19H9.5A9.5 9.5 0 0 0 0 28.5z\" fill=\"#a259ff\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1\">\n              <div class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Asset Telemetry</div>\n              <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/50\">Design vector streaming</div>\n            </div>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-white/40\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"app-row group w-full flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-left transition bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/10\">\n            <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#1a1a1a] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n              <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 170\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M89 4.6L11 36.5C5 39 5 47 11 49.5l78 31.7c7 2.8 14.7 2.8 21.7 0L189 49.5c6-2.5 6-10.5 0-13L111 4.6c-7-2.8-15-2.8-22 0z\" fill=\"#FFBF00\"/><path d=\"M5 73.4v82c0 3.3 2 6.3 5 7.6l81 33.1V104.4L5 73.4z\" fill=\"#26B5F8\"/><path d=\"M195 73.4v82c0 3.3-2 6.3-5 7.6l-81 33.1V104.4l86-31z\" fill=\"#ED3049\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1\">\n              <div class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Data Indexing</div>\n              <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/50\">Relational DB linkage</div>\n            </div>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-white/40\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: Isometric 3D Vis System -->\n      <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-[600px]\">\n        <div class=\"chart-stage relative w-full max-w-[560px] aspect-[2.3/1.9]\">\n\n          <!-- cyan glow under platform -->\n          <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 bottom-[6%] -translate-x-1/2 w-[80%] h-[80px] blur-[20px]\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,229,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n\n          <!-- WebGL ThreeJS Canvas -->\n          <canvas id=\"insight-3d-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-[1] pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n          <!-- Floating Labels -->\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[15%] left-[8%] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#111111]/90 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md whitespace-nowrap z-10 text-[0.65rem] text-white/80\">Active Nodes</div>\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[23%] left-[12%] px-2 py-1 text-xs font-normal text-[#00E5FF] z-10\">18.3k</div>\n\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[5%] left-[47%] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#111111]/90 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md whitespace-nowrap z-10 text-[0.65rem] text-white/80\">Core Temp</div>\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[13%] left-[50%] px-2 py-1 text-sm font-normal text-white z-10\">34°C</div>\n\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[25%] right-[5%] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#111111]/90 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md whitespace-nowrap z-10 text-[0.65rem] text-white/80\">Throughput</div>\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute top-[33%] right-[9%] px-2 py-1 text-xs font-normal text-[#00E5FF] z-10\">99.9%</div>\n\n          <!-- Bottom badges -->\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute bottom-[14%] left-[6%] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#111111]/95 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap z-10\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-up-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-[#00E5FF]\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/85\">7.6% sync rate</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute bottom-[22%] left-[42%] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#111111]/95 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap z-10\">\n            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00E5FF] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00E5FF] block\"></span>\n            <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/85\">System Stable</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"float-tag absolute bottom-[12%] right-[4%] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#111111]/95 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap z-10\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:round-transfer-horizontal-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-[#00E5FF]\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-white/85\">Rebalancing</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom strip / metrics row -->\n    <div class=\"mt-24 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#050507]\">\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-normal tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/50\">Endpoints</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight\">256+</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] mt-1 text-white/50\">Active secure tunnels</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#050507]\">\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-normal tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/50\">Ping</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight\">12ms</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] mt-1 text-white/50\">Average packet transit</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#050507]\">\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-normal tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/50\">Clusters</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight\">12,040</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] mt-1 text-white/50\">Concurrent active clusters</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#050507]\">\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-normal tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/50\">Reliability</div>\n        <div class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight\">99.999%</div>\n        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] mt-1 text-white/50\">Annual guaranteed SLA</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Footer strip -->\n  <footer class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/5\">\n    <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40 uppercase\">© 2026 AuraCore Labs — All rights reserved</div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-xs text-white/50\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition\">Status</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition\">Privacy</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition\">Terms</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition\">Changelog</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// ==== Masked word reveal ====\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.word-mask').forEach(el => {\n  el.style.display = 'inline-block';\n  el.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n  el.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n  el.style.marginRight = '0.18em';\n  el.style.lineHeight = '1';\n  el.style.paddingBottom = '0.05em';\n});\ngsap.set('.word', { yPercent: 100, display: 'inline-block' });\ngsap.to('.word', { yPercent: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: 'power4.out', stagger: 0.08, delay: 0.1 });\n\n// Float tags pulse\ngsap.from('.float-tag', { opacity: 0, y: 8, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.06, delay: 0.6, ease: 'power3.out' });\n\n// ====== Isometric 3D Visualization System ======\n(function(){\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('insight-3d-canvas');\n  if (!canvas || !window.THREE) return;\n\n  const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n  const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n  const d = 11;\n  const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-d, d, d, -d, 1, 1000);\n  camera.position.set(20, 20, 20);\n  camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\n  scene.add(group);\n\n  // Three-tier lighting\n  const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.4);\n  scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n  const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 0.8);\n  dirLight.position.set(10, 20, 10);\n  scene.add(dirLight);\n\n  const pointLight = new THREE.PointLight(0x00E5FF, 2.0, 50);\n  pointLight.position.set(0, 4, 0);\n  group.add(pointLight);\n\n  // Materials\n  const baseMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x111111, roughness: 0.8, metalness: 0.2 });\n  const coreMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x111111, emissive: 0x00E5FF, emissiveIntensity: 0.8, roughness: 0.2 });\n  const wireMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x333333, transparent: true, opacity: 0.3 });\n\n  // Geometry: Tiered Base Platform\n  const platformGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(14, 1.5, 14);\n  const platform = new THREE.Mesh(platformGeo, baseMat);\n  platform.position.y = -3;\n  group.add(platform);\n  platform.add(new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(platformGeo), wireMat));\n\n  const tierGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(8, 1.5, 8);\n  const tier = new THREE.Mesh(tierGeo, baseMat);\n  tier.position.y = -1.5;\n  group.add(tier);\n  tier.add(new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(tierGeo), wireMat));\n\n  const tier2Geo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(4, 1.5, 4);\n  const tier2 = new THREE.Mesh(tier2Geo, baseMat);\n  tier2.position.y = 0;\n  group.add(tier2);\n  tier2.add(new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(tier2Geo), wireMat));\n\n  // Geometry: Central Logic Core\n  const coreGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(1.5, 5, 1.5);\n  const core = new THREE.Mesh(coreGeo, coreMat);\n  core.position.y = 3.25;\n  group.add(core);\n\n  // Geometry: Holographic Rings\n  const ringGeo1 = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(4.5, 4.5, 0.5, 8, 1, true);\n  const ringGeo2 = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(6.5, 6.5, 0.5, 8, 1, true);\n  const ringMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x00E5FF, transparent: true, opacity: 0.3 });\n\n  const r1 = new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(ringGeo1), ringMat);\n  r1.position.y = 2;\n  group.add(r1);\n\n  const r2 = new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(ringGeo2), ringMat);\n  r2.position.y = 4;\n  group.add(r2);\n\n  // Geometry: Floor Grid Helper\n  const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(24, 24, 0x333333, 0x333333);\n  gridHelper.position.y = -3.75;\n  gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n  gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.2;\n  group.add(gridHelper);\n\n  // Data Nodes\n  const nodes = [];\n  const nodeGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.8, 0.8, 0.8);\n  for(let i=0; i<6; i++) {\n    const n = new THREE.Mesh(nodeGeo, coreMat);\n    n.add(new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.EdgesGeometry(nodeGeo), new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x00E5FF, transparent: true, opacity: 0.6 })));\n\n    const angle = (i / 6) * Math.PI * 2;\n    const r = 7 + Math.random() * 2;\n    n.userData = {\n      baseY: 1 + Math.random() * 4,\n      offset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n      speed: 1.5 + Math.random() * 1.0\n    };\n    n.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * r, n.userData.baseY, Math.sin(angle) * r);\n    group.add(n);\n    nodes.push(n);\n  }\n\n  function resize() {\n    const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n    if (!parent) return;\n    const w = parent.clientWidth;\n    const h = parent.clientHeight;\n    renderer.setSize(w, h, false);\n    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n    const aspect = w / h;\n    camera.left = -d * aspect;\n    camera.right = d * aspect;\n    camera.top = d;\n    camera.bottom = -d;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  setTimeout(resize, 50);\n\n  const start = performance.now();\n  function animate() {\n    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    const time = (performance.now() - start) * 0.001;\n\n    // Pulse Logic (2s cycle)\n    const pulse = (Math.sin(time * Math.PI) + 1) * 0.5;\n    coreMat.emissiveIntensity = 0.5 + pulse * 0.5;\n    pointLight.intensity = 1.0 + pulse * 2.0;\n\n    // Orbital Drift\n    group.rotation.y = Math.sin(time * 0.2) * 0.2 + time * 0.15;\n\n    // Node Behavior\n    nodes.forEach((node) => {\n      node.position.y = node.userData.baseY + Math.sin(time * node.userData.speed + node.userData.offset) * 1.2;\n      node.rotation.x = time * 0.5;\n      node.rotation.y = time * 0.5;\n    });\n\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n  }\n  animate();\n})();\n\n// ====== WebGL Dot-matrix background ======\n(function(){\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n  if (!canvas || !window.THREE) return;\n  let renderer;\n  try {\n    renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n  } catch(e){ return; }\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n  const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n  const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1,1,1,-1,0,1);\n\n  const uniforms = {\n    uTime: { value: 0 },\n    uRes: { value: new THREE.Vector2(1,1) },\n    uMouse: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0.5, 0.5) }\n  };\n\n  const frag = `\n  precision highp float;\n  uniform float uTime;\n  uniform vec2 uRes;\n  uniform vec2 uMouse;\n\n  float rand(vec2 p){ return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453); }\n\n  void main(){\n    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / uRes.xy;\n    vec2 p = uv - 0.5;\n    p.x *= uRes.x / uRes.y;\n\n    vec2 m = (uMouse - 0.5);\n    p += m * 0.04;\n\n    float r2 = dot(p,p);\n    p *= 1.0 + 0.2 * r2;\n\n    float scale = 90.0;\n    vec2 g = p * scale;\n    vec2 cell = floor(g);\n    vec2 f = fract(g) - 0.5;\n    float d = length(f);\n\n    float radial = smoothstep(0.95, 0.1, length(p));\n    float pulse = 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(uTime * 0.6 - length(p)*3.0);\n    float seed = rand(cell);\n    float visible = step(0.6, seed);\n\n    float dot = smoothstep(0.08, 0.0, d) * visible;\n    float intensity = dot * radial * (0.35 + 0.65 * pulse);\n\n    float scan = 0.92 + 0.08 * sin(gl_FragCoord.y * 1.2);\n    intensity *= scan;\n\n    float flicker = 0.95 + 0.05 * rand(vec2(floor(uTime*8.0), cell.x));\n    intensity *= flicker;\n\n    float gl = step(0.997, rand(vec2(floor(uTime*3.0), floor(gl_FragCoord.y * 0.05))));\n    intensity += gl * 0.15 * visible;\n\n    vec3 col = vec3(1.0) * intensity;\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(col, intensity * 0.9);\n  }`;\n\n  const vert = `void main(){ gl_Position = vec4(position,1.0); }`;\n  const mat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({ uniforms, vertexShader: vert, fragmentShader: frag, transparent: true });\n  const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2,2), mat);\n  scene.add(mesh);\n\n  function resize(){\n    const w = window.innerWidth, h = window.innerHeight;\n    renderer.setSize(w, h, false);\n    uniforms.uRes.value.set(w * renderer.getPixelRatio(), h * renderer.getPixelRatio());\n  }\n  resize();\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n  let tx = 0.5, ty = 0.5;\n  window.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n    tx = e.clientX / window.innerWidth;\n    ty = 1.0 - e.clientY / window.innerHeight;\n  });\n\n  const start = performance.now();\n  function tick(){\n    const t = (performance.now() - start) / 1000;\n    uniforms.uTime.value = t;\n    uniforms.uMouse.value.x += (tx - uniforms.uMouse.value.x) * 0.04;\n    uniforms.uMouse.value.y += (ty - uniforms.uMouse.value.y) * 0.04;\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n    requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  tick();\n})();\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "auracore-spatial-visualization-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/auracore-spatial-visualization-system.jpg", "source_name": "auracore-spatial-visualization-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 213, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T14:08:39.744758+00:00"}